+<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>QIK-VRT Node a84f157a</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#0c0f14;color:#e8edf5;font:16px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;padding:28px}a{color:#9ecbff}code{word-break:break-all}.box{max-width:900px;border:1px solid #303746;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;background:#151a22}</style><div class="box"><h1>QIK-VRT NODE</h1><p>Repository: <strong>ingolf-lohmann/qik-vrt</strong></p><p>GUID: <code>a84f157a-cef2-4c47-bca9-8f407085bdbe</code></p><p>Canonical node URL: <code>https://goldkelch.github.io/qik-vrt/mesh/nodes/a84f157a-cef2-4c47-bca9-8f407085bdbe/</code></p><p><a href="../../?node=a84f157a-cef2-4c47-bca9-8f407085bdbe">Open in Authority mesh terminal</a></p><p>This stable page delegates live state rendering to the Authority mesh terminal. Event state is never inferred from page age.</p></div>
\ No newline at end of file
